  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Reform Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to provide assistance to the Ministry of Education (MOE) and competitively selected regions of Russia to reform general and initial vocational education in order to:  - improve quality and standards; - promote the efficient and equitable use of scarce public resources for education; - modernize the education system (structure of network and institutions); - improve the flexibility and market relevance of initial vocational education.</narrative>
  </description>
